**Fukiko.** A young magical girl channeling her late mother's power,
guided by her feline companion Azyrus. Raised on shoujo manga, Fukiko
never expected her own fantasies to come true -- until a strange
winged cat named Azyrus appeared at her window one night and revealed
that her late mother had secretly been a magical crime fighter.
Fukiko's locket, a keepsake from her mother, turned out to hold that
same power, and so the heroine Lovely Savior Myu Myu was born.
Strong-willed and naive, Fukiko expects the world to play fair by her
own rules. That same faith lets her see the good in bad situations,
though her childish streak can also mean a fair amount of whining.
*Companion +2 (Azyrus), Cute! +2, Iron-Willed +1, Knowledge +2 (Shoujo
Manga), Quick +2, Shape-Shifter +2, Transformation +4; Ageism -2,
Crybaby -2, Easily Distracted -1, Focus -2 (Powers Require Neko
Transformation Locket), Frail -1, Naive -1.* Neko Neko Catnip Cantrip
(Affinity: Love; Ranged): Roll 4, DX 3, End 0. In her magical girl
form, Fukiko can perform a variety of mystical attacks of love. Neko
Neko Heart Burst (Affinity: Love; Effective x2, Ranged): Roll 4, DX 5,
End 10. Fukiko forms her hands into the shape of a heart over her
chest and emits a barrage of magical heart-shaped bursts. Neko Neko
Wave (Affinity: Love; Area Effect x2, Stunning; No Damage): Roll 4, DX
0, End 10. With a waving motion of her arms, Fukiko pushes away all
opponents around her. Neko Neko Yarn Entangle (Affinity: Love;
Paralyzing): Roll 4, DX 3, End 10. A ball of yarn magically appears
and wraps around her target. Defense 4/5. Health 30, Endurance 40.
TV 12.

**Companion: Azyrus.** *Flight +2, Quick +1, Smart +2; Awkward Size -1
(Small), Frail -1, Short-Tempered -1.*

**Transformation.** Grants: Attack +2, Barrier +3 [Perks: Area Effect;
Flaws: Elaborate Gestures; 5 Endurance] (provides an alternate Defense
Roll (the second Defense value in Combat, below)), Combat Expert +2,
Healer +2; Bizarre Appearance -1 (Cat Features).

